komponenten-chips-badges-pills-chip.apiDescription:
## Inputs

```
export type ChipComponentInputs = {
  /** Markenbereich → data-area (area-aware Outline). */
  area?: CdsArea;
  /** Sichtbarer Text des Chips. */
  label: string;
  /**
   * Gedrückt/aktiv → aria-pressed. Two-Way (`[(pressed)]`) + pressedChange via model().
   *
   * @default false
   */
  pressed?: boolean; // two-way: [(pressed)]
}
```

## Outputs

```
export type ChipComponentOutputs = {
  /** Gedrückt/aktiv → aria-pressed. Two-Way (`[(pressed)]`) + pressedChange via model(). */
  pressedChange: (e: boolean) => void;
}
```
